   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about studies",
     "texto": [
      "**Fag** is a subject or course; **timeplan** is the class timetable. **Friminutt** is the break between classes.",
      "To explain a reason, use **fordi** («because»): **Jeg øver fordi jeg har eksamen**. In a clause that starts with **fordi**, **ikke** goes before the verb: **fordi jeg ikke forstår**. In English, «not» usually comes after the auxiliary: «because I don't understand»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Studies and work",
     "texto": [
      "In Norway, **samfunnskunnskap** is a subject about society. **Oppmøte** means attendance at class; **fravær** means absence. **Bestå en eksamen** means to pass an exam."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
